{# The HTML twin of the confirmation. No link back in, on purpose. #}
<p>Hello {{ username }},</p>

<p>
  The password for <strong>{{ username }}</strong> on {{ site.title }} has just
  been set through a reset link.{% if signedOut %} Every browser that was signed in as {{ username }} was signed out.{% endif %}
</p>

<p>If that was you, there is nothing to do.</p>

<p>
  If it was not, somebody has your email and your account. Sign in at
  <a href="{{ baseUrl }}/admin/login">{{ baseUrl }}/admin/login</a> with the new
  password if you have it, and ask whoever runs this site to look at the account
  if you do not.
</p>

<p>&mdash; {{ site.title }}</p>
